s pasted or regenerated after the last JPEG save often show a different error level.","data":{"p99_over_median":6.488376266297544}},{"id":"clm_a47c8b39b60b","case_id":"case_89a1fd7baac3","media_id":"med_30facb5825d0","stage":"decomposition","category":"noise","statement":"Sensor-noise residual is inconsistent across regions (block coefficient of variation 0.97)","status":"Inferred","strength":"Weak","polarity":"supports_manipulation","evidence_refs":["6fd98124647f14f1b621a9601816d5230a31bb0e32a176cf8c93784265fe7ea3","2db8711e2d378355b4dce7797ce4bfe4c66577b0f6086f8ddd3d244c97d16713"],"produced_by":"image_forensics@1.0","sources":["image_forensics@1.0"],"limitations":"Texture, exposure, denoising and blur all change local noise. Requires visual review of the map; does not identify a generator.","what_would_confirm":"","why":"Camera images carry roughly uniform sensor noise; spliced or regenerated regions often differ.","data":{"block_cv":0.9667878746986389}},{"id":"clm_ee08f048ba8f","case_id":"case_89a1fd7baac3","media_id":"med_30facb5825d0","stage":"decomposition","category":"spectrum","statement":"Frequency spectrum shows no strong periodic peaks (peak score 2.8)","status":"Inferred","strength":"Weak","polarity":"neutral","evidence_refs":["6fd98124647f14f1b621a9601816d5230a31bb0e32a176cf8c93784265fe7ea3","fd5378d7b2fe7846a80899aefec709fcf665291cab7c8e81b449a23587a0b8c3"],"produced_by":"image_forensics@1.0","sources":["image_forensics@1.0"],"limitations":"Resizing, JPEG 8×8 blocking, screen capture moiré and halftone patterns also create peaks. Modern diffusion models often leave none.","what_would_confirm":"","why":"Transposed-convolution / upsampling in many GANs and some diffusion decoders leaves grid-like spectral peaks.","data":{"peak_score":2.7659065637692013,"n_peaks":0}},{"id":"clm_0010a1415650","case_id":"case_89a1fd7baac3","media_id":"med_30facb5825d0","stage":"decomposition","category":"jpeg_ghost","statement":"No clear double-compression signature","statu