d7c8"],"limitations":"Weaker on SD3/Flux and on derivative images (screenshots, memes, photos of screens); does not detect local edits or face swaps.","what_would_confirm":"Agreement from an independent detector family or provenance data.","why":"SPAI learns the frequency spectrum of real camera photos and flags images whose spectrum it cannot reconstruct — typical of image generators.","data":{"score":8.603058813605458e-05,"model":"SPAI","analysed":"whole image","head":"ai_generated"}},{"id":"clm_8fa98f9a217a","case_id":"case_89a1fd7baac3","media_id":"med_30facb5825d0","stage":"decomposition","category":"tamper","statement":"TruFor (edit detector): no clear sign of local editing (integrity model output 0.34; 17% of the picture highlighted)","status":"Inferred","strength":"Weak","polarity":"neutral","evidence_refs":["6fd98124647f14f1b621a9601816d5230a31bb0e32a176cf8c93784265fe7ea3","82a46d14661d27040b48f238973c20e2dc2f1008e123b73940155dcbe8e1bf44"],"produced_by":"trufor@1.0#953f1f7eda0d","sources":["trufor@1.0#953f1f7eda0d"],"limitations":"Fully AI-generated images may look 'consistent' (no splice boundary); heavy recompression and resizing reduce sensitivity.","what_would_confirm":"","why":"TruFor combines the image with its camera-noise fingerprint (Noiseprint++) to find regions whose noise does not match the rest — the trace of splicing, copy-move or inpainting.","data":{"score":0.339187890291214,"suspect_area":0.1666455078125,"model":"TruFor","head":"edited"}},{"id":"clm_8ced9e94a417","case_id":"case_89a1fd7baac3","media_id":"med_30facb5825d0","stage":"decomposition","category":"faceswap","statement":"SBI (face-swap detector): no face-swap blending traces (highest face output 0.02 across 1 face(s))","status":"Inferred","strength":"Weak","polarity":"neutral","evidence_refs":["6fd98124647f14f1b621a9601816d5230a31bb0e32a176cf8c93784265fe7ea3"],"produced_by":"sbi@1.0#2b05c2ba36cc","sources":["sbi@1.0#2b05c2ba36cc"],"limitations":"Needs a reasonably sized, frontal face; fully generated faces (no blending boundary) and tiny or heavily compressed faces are harder. Faces generated entirely by AI (no blending) can also score high.","what_would_confirm":"","why":"SBI was trained to spot the boundary left when one face is blended onto another — without ever seeing a specific deepfake tool, so it also reacts to unseen face-swap methods.","data":{"faces":[{"box":[260,105,238,350],"score":0.020883796736598015,"face_px":238}],"max_score":0.020883796736598015,"model":"SBI (FF++ c23)","head":"edited"}},{"id":"clm_ec758d4745aa","case_id":"case_89a1fd7baac3","media_id":"med_30facb5825d0","stage":"decomposition","category":"ocr","statement":"No burned-in text detected","status":"Unknown","strength":"None","polarity":"neutral","evidence_refs":["6fd98124647f14f1b621a9601816d5230a31bb0e32a176cf8c93784265fe7ea3"],"produced_by":"ocr@1.0","sources":["ocr@1.0"],"limitations":"","what_would_confirm":"","why":"","data":{}},{"id":"clm_94bf8f398efd","case_id":"case_89a1fd7baac3","media_id":"med_30facb5825d0","stage":"decomposition","category":"forensic_module","statement":"Camera-processing fingerprints: None of the four camera-processing traces could be found. This is what resized, re-encoded, screenshotted, rendered or generated pixels look like — and also what a social-media copy of a real photo looks like.","status":"Lead","strength":"Weak","polarity":"neutral","evidence_refs":["6fd98124647f14f1b621a9601816d5230a31bb0e32a176cf8c93784265fe7ea3","5c6a7c9736a7c8611f168359a48e548f14349daa3aa579c7818275ca986ec277"],"produced_by":"forensic_suite@1.0","sources":["forensic_module:camera_pipeline@1.0"],"limitations":"This does NOT mean the image is fake. Treat it as: origin cannot be supported from the pixels.","what_would_confirm":"Independent confirmation with a validated method, reference material, or the original file.","why":"","data":{"module":"camera_pipeline","finding":"profile.camera_like","kind":"hypothesis","confidence":0.25,"validation_tier":"syn